  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Timobaisa korua eng’iti ende yonsi, chiombe, gose ching’ondi, gose chimbori, ey’ere n’ekemocho ase omobere oye, ebe ekeng’wanso ase Omonene Nyasae oino. Eyio nigo ere okogeechia ase are.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“N’enyaare koba ng’a agwo ase omochie onde oino ase eyi’Omonene Nyasae oino, arabae, omonto, omosacha gose omokungu, anyorekane okorire amabe ase obosio bw’Omonene Nyasae oino, ase ogosaria okobwatana kwaye kw’ogotianania,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na gosasiima chinyasae ching’ao na gochikorera ase ogosasiima risase, gose omotienyi, gose ching’enang’eni chia igoro, ebio abakanirie ng’a timobisasiima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komorateebigwe amang’ana buna ayio erio moyauna‐unie. Onye mokonyora ekeene ng’a amang’ana ayio akorirwe ase egati y’Abaisraeli,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "erio nario moraarente agwo ase ebiita biaino omonto oria, omosacha gose omokungu, oyio okorire ogokora okwo okobe, erio momoake amagena goika akwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oyio nigo araitwe ase oborori bw’ abanto babere gose batato, korende tagoitwa ase oborori bw’omonto oyomo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto baria birori nabwo barabe abatang’ani komoaka amagena ase okomoita, na magega yabo abanto bande bamanye komoaka amagena. Naboigo morarusie obobe bwonsi korwa ase more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye amang’ana arentirwe ase more, ayaare amakong’u koyanacha, karabe amang’ana ogoiterwa kw’amanyinga, gose ay’ogokora oboronge ase omonto, gose obobe omonto akoreire omonto onde, gose ekiina kende gionsi kere egekong’u ase more agwo ase emechie yaino, erio moimoke mogeende aase agwo Omonene Nyasae oino, arachoore,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mogeende ase abakuani Abalawi n’aase omogambi bw’engaki eyio. Mobateebie amang’ana ayio amakong’u, na barabwo ’nabaanache ekiina kia boronge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Morende mono na gokora amang’ana ayio barabwo barabateebie korwa aase agwo Omonene arachoore. Mokore koreng’ana buna barabasemie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mokore koreng’ana buna barabateebererie, na buna baranache ekiina aase more; timotiga ogoseemia kwabo na koonchoka aande, gochia ase ensemo y’okorio gose ey’okobee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto onde bwensi ore omomwenu na okwanga koigwera Omokuani oyio ogotenena agwo ase obosio bw’Omonene Nyasae oino, gose aange koigwera omogambi, ere goika aitwe akwe. Goika morusie obobe borue ase Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero abanto bonsi baraigwe amang’ana ayio mbairoke, tibakora ogokora kw’obomwenu naende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogoseemigwa ase ogochoora omorwoti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekero moraabe mwaikire na komenya ase ense eyi’Omonene Nyasae oino, agochia kobaa ebe eyaino, aande moganie omorwoti abagaambere, buna ebisaku biria bibaetanaine bibwate abarwoti baabo bakobagaambera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio mobeeke omorwoti oyi’Omonene Nyasae oino, arabachoorere. Mobeeke omonto bw’ abanto bamino abe omorwoti igoro ase more, korende omonto otari bw’egesaku kiaino timomobeeka abe omorwoti oino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti oyio takwementera chibarasi chinyinge, gose tabaisa gotoma abanto bairane Misiri ase ogochia korigia chibarasi chinyinge, ekiagera Omonene obateebirie ng’a timokonyaara koirana gochia ase enchera eria naende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti oria taba na abakungu abange, ekiagera ayio nigo aragere enkoro yaye eonchoke etige Omonene, gose takorigia kwementera chitaabu ne’chifeta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero aikaransire ase ekerogo ki’obonene ase oborwoti bwaye, arente egetabu y’amachiiko korwa ase abakuani, Abalawi, naende ariike amang’ana ayio ayio ase egetabu ende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere natware egetabu eyio abe ogosooma amachiiko ayio onsi ase amatuko y’obogima bwaye bwonsi, erio neorokererie komoiroka Omonene, Nyasae oye, na koreenda amang’ana onsi y’ogochika okwo na ay’emeroberio echiikire, na koyakora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goika akore igo, erinde tabaisa koenena ase ogochaaya abanto bande bamwabo, gose tabaisa koonchoka korwa ase amachiiko na kogeenda ase ensemo y’okorio gose ey’okobee. Karaigwere, ere amo n’abana baye ’mbabe bakogaambera Abaisraeli ase engaki entambe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
